Copied or adapted from bitmagnet:

  internal/lexer             the bencode-style lexer
  internal/regex             regular expression helpers
  internal/keywords          the keyword parsing mini-language
  internal/concurrency       the atomic value and the keyed rate limiter
  internal/protocol          protocol identifiers, DHT messages, node addresses
                             and information, scraping, the routing table and
                             its btree, the KRPC responder, the UDP server and
                             its client, metainfo parsing, the BEP 9/10
                             metadata requester, and the metainfo banning
                             checks
  internal/dhtcrawler        imported from bitmagnet and since substantially
                             rewritten: dependency injection and metrics were
                             removed, logging moved to log/slog, and the crawl
                             loop was restructured

The imported files have their import paths and package documentation changed,
the dependency-injection plumbing and generated mocks removed, logging moved to
log/slog, and defects fixed on import. Files added to these packages after the
import, such as new tests and dependency-injection adapters, are original work.

Measured against bitmagnet at the commit above, about 3,400 lines, or 16 per
cent of the Go code in this repository, remain line-for-line derived from it.
The dhtcrawler package measures far lower because it was rewritten, but it is
still derived work.

All other files are original work and are covered by the MIT licence in
LICENSE.

